    "sections": {
        "description": "The Ambulance Paramedics WordPress theme is a professional, responsive, and mobile-friendly solution designed for ambulance services, EMS providers, and emergency responders. Ideal for showcasing emergency medical transport, 24/7 service availability, and specialized care units like air and neonatal ambulances, this theme offers a clean, trustworthy design that boosts patient confidence. It includes features like ambulance booking, online scheduling, CTA buttons, and service overviews, all optimized for performance and accessibility. With customizable sections and retina-ready visuals, it ensures a seamless experience across all devices, helping providers present critical information quickly and effectively."
    },
